From: relay12 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] dtl: separate the optional display-kernel present path

d3dkmthk.h is a WDK header that no public SDK ships and MinGW-w64 does not
have, and including it unconditionally from the dependency edge stopped the
preprocessor before anything else could be reached. It was the recorded
compiler boundary.

Nothing about the boundary needed the complete type. Every declaration in the
tree -- the pKMTPresent member of PresentCBArgs, the two ImmediateContext
present signatures, and SwapChainHelper::StandardPresent -- names
D3DKMT_PRESENT only through a pointer, and a pointer to an incomplete type is
ABI-complete. So the dependency edge forward declares the struct instead of
including the header, and every one of those declarations still compiles
unchanged, at the same layout.

Two translation units genuinely need the definition, because they dereference
it: SwapChainHelper.cpp reads FlipInterval, and ImmediateContext.cpp reads
Flags.RedirectedFlip and hWindow. Both are the display-kernel present path,
which this port disables -- Wine's DXGI emulates presentation above the DDI,
as docs/D3D11ON12-SKIPPABLE-ELEMENTS.md section 1 describes -- so they are
compiled only when TRANSLATION_LAYER_SUPPORTS_D3DKMT_PRESENT is defined,
which is never in this build.

Their declarations are deliberately left visible. Gating those too would
change the shape of PresentCBArgs, and a caller that reaches for the KMT
present path should fail to link against a path this port does not build
rather than silently compile against a different struct.

The two include lines stay in the inventory on purpose. They are still
present, now behind a gate, so the count is unchanged and the evidence for
this step is the advanced compiler boundary rather than a smaller number.
---
diff --git a/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h b/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h
index 1ab7819..377d66e 100644
--- a/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h
+++ b/include/D3D12TranslationLayerDependencyIncludes.h
@@ -30,7 +30,17 @@
 #include <directx/d3dx12.h>
 #include <d3d11_3.h>
 #include <dxgi1_5.h>
+// The display-kernel present path is optional, and d3dkmthk.h is a WDK
+// header no public SDK ships. Every declaration in this tree names
+// D3DKMT_PRESENT only through a pointer, and a pointer to an incomplete
+// type is ABI-complete, so the forward declaration below keeps all of them
+// compiling. Only the two translation units that dereference it need the
+// real header, and they are gated on the same macro.
+#ifdef TRANSLATION_LAYER_SUPPORTS_D3DKMT_PRESENT
 #include <d3dkmthk.h>
+#else
+typedef struct _D3DKMT_PRESENT D3DKMT_PRESENT;
+#endif
 
 //STL
 #include <utility>
diff --git a/include/SwapChainHelper.hpp b/include/SwapChainHelper.hpp
index 822aefa..90502f0 100644
--- a/include/SwapChainHelper.hpp
+++ b/include/SwapChainHelper.hpp
@@ -1,5 +1,9 @@
 #pragma once
+// Only the pointer is named here, so this header needs nothing more than
+// the forward declaration the dependency edge provides.
+#ifdef TRANSLATION_LAYER_SUPPORTS_D3DKMT_PRESENT
 #include "d3dkmthk.h"
+#endif
 
 namespace D3D12TranslationLayer
 {
diff --git a/src/ImmediateContext.cpp b/src/ImmediateContext.cpp
index fe7b157..1dc3e6f 100644
--- a/src/ImmediateContext.cpp
+++ b/src/ImmediateContext.cpp
@@ -5693,6 +5693,11 @@ void TRANSLATION_API ImmediateContext::SharingContractPresent(_In_ Resource* pRe
 }
 
 //----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Both definitions below dereference pKMTPresent, so unlike every declaration
+// of them they need the complete D3DKMT_PRESENT. The display-kernel present
+// path is disabled in this port -- Wine's DXGI emulates presentation above
+// the DDI -- so they compile only when the WDK header is available.
+#ifdef TRANSLATION_LAYER_SUPPORTS_D3DKMT_PRESENT
 void TRANSLATION_API ImmediateContext::Present(
     _In_reads_(uSrcSurfaces) PresentSurface const* pSrcSurfaces,
     UINT numSrcSurfaces,
@@ -5822,6 +5827,7 @@ HRESULT TRANSLATION_API ImmediateContext::CloseAndSubmitGraphicsCommandListForPr
 
     return S_OK;
 }
+#endif // TRANSLATION_LAYER_SUPPORTS_D3DKMT_PRESENT
 
 //----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ImmediateContext::BltResolveManager::BltResolveManager(D3D12TranslationLayer::ImmediateContext& ImmCtx)
diff --git a/src/SwapChainHelper.cpp b/src/SwapChainHelper.cpp
index f764777..32319b1 100644
--- a/src/SwapChainHelper.cpp
+++ b/src/SwapChainHelper.cpp
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
+// This translation unit dereferences pKMTPresent, so it needs the complete
+// D3DKMT_PRESENT rather than the forward declaration the headers use.
+#ifdef TRANSLATION_LAYER_SUPPORTS_D3DKMT_PRESENT
 #include "pch.h"
 #include "SwapChainHelper.hpp"
 
@@ -43,4 +46,5 @@ namespace D3D12TranslationLayer
 
         return hr;
     }
-}
\ No newline at end of file
+}
+#endif // TRANSLATION_LAYER_SUPPORTS_D3DKMT_PRESENT
